OL,3,GNEWSALabour MP decries talk of fresh
OL,4,ABrexit referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labour MP has said she could not
OL,7,Fsupport a fresh referendum on Brexit.
OL,9,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham recently
OL,10,Fsuggested now was not the right time
OL,11,Ffor another referendum, but the UK
OL,12,Fneeded to consider all options.
OL,14,FHe said it was "possible" a future
OL,15,FLabour election manifesto could promise
OL,16,Fa new in-out referendum on the European
OL,17,FUnion.
OL,19,FHowever, speaking to the BBC's Politics
OL,20,FNorth programme, Great Grimsby and
OL,21,FCleethorpes MP Melanie Onn insisted it
OL,22,Fwould be the wrong thing to do.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
